# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1766
translate brazilian c32s002_choices_e46690a8:

    # ama "Imagine if [dam] could buy three Ferrarinis at once."
    ama "Imagina se o [dam] pudesse comprar três Ferrarinis de uma vez."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1767
translate brazilian c32s002_choices_2f664a1c:

    # ama "Surely afterwards there would be envy between those who still have the money and those who have squandered it."
    ama "Com certeza depois haveria inveja entre aqueles que ainda têm o dinheiro e aqueles que o desperdiçaram."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1768
translate brazilian c32s002_choices_3f0c5e93:

    # mc "Your idea about the economics courses is what made me choose that option."
    mc "Sua ideia sobre os cursos de economia foi o que me fez escolher essa opção."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1769
translate brazilian c32s002_choices_37aaee9f:

    # mc "We know that, this way, they'll still receive their money, but they'll have time to learn how to manage it."
    mc "Sabemos que, desse jeito, eles ainda vão receber o dinheiro deles, mas terão tempo para aprender a administrá-lo."
# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1771
translate brazilian c32s002_choices_ffa03737:

    # ama "If you had implemented it and someone had asked for [mael]'s position without having the knowledge..."
    ama "Se você tivesse implementado isso e alguém tivesse pedido o cargo do [mael] sem ter o conhecimento..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1772
translate brazilian c32s002_choices_8f5f7bdb:

    # mc "I would have had to reject the request and it would look like an empty promise."
    mc "Eu teria que rejeitar o pedido e pareceria uma promessa vazia."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1773
translate brazilian c32s002_choices_6dcb76b4:

    # ama "But nevertheless, you leave the door open for them to train for those positions. And to apply for the ones they do know how to perform."
    ama "Mas mesmo assim, você deixa a porta aberta para que eles treinem para esses cargos. E para se candidatarem àqueles que eles sabem como desempenhar."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1774
translate brazilian c32s002_choices_297cb421:

    # mc "That's why I opted for this option. I think it's going to be safer for everyone and we'll avoid disappointments."
    mc "É por isso que optei por essa opção. Acho que vai ser mais seguro para todo mundo e vamos evitar decepções."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1776
