# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2802
translate brazilian c32s004_routine_221f4f70:

    # "You spend the rest of the nights with [bet], who is enjoying her newly rediscovered sexuality and making up for lots of years without sex."
    "Você passa o resto das noites com [bet], que está aproveitando sua sexualidade recém-redescoberta e compensando os muitos anos sem sexo."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2803
translate brazilian c32s004_routine_2e2880e9:

    # "[ama] usually disappears discreetly when she sees you start kissing passionately."
    "[ama] geralmente desaparece discretamente quando vê vocês começarem a se beijar apaixonadamente."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2806
translate brazilian c32s004_routine_02fabee4:

    # "One morning, after breakfast, [bet] informs you that she's pregnant. She finally decided to take the pregnancy test."
