    # "The four women continue hugging each other, switching arms, and that's when you feel your arms strangely empty."
    "As quatro mulheres continuam se abraçando, trocando de braços, e é aí que você sente seus braços estranhamente vazios."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2901
translate brazilian c32s004_MarSamArrival_a80fe51d:

    # ama "We should get going if you want to drop your things off at the house before we go to have lunch."
    ama "Deveríamos ir se vocês quiserem deixar as coisas na casa antes de irmos almoçar."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2902
translate brazilian c32s004_MarSamArrival_5c1dfd8b:

    # mom "If it's safe to leave the bags in the car, there's no need."
    mom "Se for seguro deixar as malas no carro, não precisa."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2903
translate brazilian c32s004_MarSamArrival_918c7e3b:

    # mc "We still have time, right? We made the reservation for over an hour from now."
    mc "Ainda temos tempo, né? Fizemos a reserva para daqui a mais de uma hora."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2905
translate brazilian c32s004_MarSamArrival_6a5478fd:

    # bet "But maybe they want to shower and change before we go."
